{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Money WASTE demo includes full exploration of Ocean City, one darknet businesses (with gameplay limited to resupply and merchandise sales), the first 9 story missions, and 2 side missions accessible via email.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong></strong><br><br><strong>WE WELCOME YOU TO OCEAN CITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After years away from your hometown, you're running low on cash. It\u2019s time to pay a visit to an old friend in Ocean City.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033760/extras/2faa14418b7e878a28266311de867a1e.poster.avif?t=1760036170\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033760/extras/2faa14418b7e878a28266311de867a1e.webm?t=1760036170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033760/extras/2faa14418b7e878a28266311de867a1e.mp4?t=1760036170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>START YOUR BUSINESS ON THE DARKNET</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire buildings across the city and turn them into your operational headquarters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the demo, you can launch two types of businesses: <i>guns trafficking and a mining farm.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033760/extras/6954745a3dc4121405d0e05ecb0e36b1.poster.avif?t=1760036170\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033760/extras/6954745a3dc4121405d0e05ecb0e36b1.webm?t=1760036170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033760/extras/6954745a3dc4121405d0e05ecb0e36b1.mp4?t=1760036170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR REPUTATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the darknet, rule number one is simple: <strong>trust only those who are trustworthy</strong>. <br>To make deals with the big players, you must <strong>be reliable and build your reputation</strong>. <br>The less reliable you are, the more you'll be forced to deal with desperate people, scammers, and amateur criminals... but nothing stops you from turning their own tricks against them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033760/extras/ac8b94c746d3549e756ee50a5cc2eb3b.poster.avif?t=1760036170\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033760/extras/ac8b94c746d3549e756ee50a5cc2eb3b.webm?t=1760036170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033760/extras/ac8b94c746d3549e756ee50a5cc2eb3b.mp4?t=1760036170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPAND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An empire doesn\u2019t build itself. If you want to grow, <strong>you\u2019ll need a team</strong>. <br><strong>Build new production lines</strong> for your businesses and <strong>hire goons</strong> to handle supply, production, and delivery.<br>Protection is essential. Only then can you get rid of the criminal organizations already present in the territory and prevent them from interfering with your operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033760/extras/c3059870c4f19de869ecc87884e24dea.poster.avif?t=1760036170\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033760/extras/c3059870c4f19de869ecc87884e24dea.webm?t=1760036170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033760/extras/c3059870c4f19de869ecc87884e24dea.mp4?t=1760036170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE A WORLD RICH IN DETAIL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>vast city of Ocean City</strong> lets you play in a <strong>rich open world</strong>, where you can cause chaos in the streets, drive and customize a wide range of vehicles, buy properties around the city and party at nightclubs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033760/extras/8938a7f7401696f40399e2efea213204.poster.avif?t=1760036170\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033760/extras/8938a7f7401696f40399e2efea213204.webm?t=1760036170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033760/extras/8938a7f7401696f40399e2efea213204.mp4?t=1760036170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4033760?t=1760036170","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4033760?t=1760036170","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033760/eba617e2ec5dca9e98ac4cf75e00661570733492/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760036170","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033760/eba617e2ec5dca9e98ac4cf75e00661570733492/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760036170","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Money WASTE demo includes full exploration of Ocean City, one darknet businesses (with gameplay limited to resupply and merchandise sales), the first 9 story missions, and 2 side missions accessible via email.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong></strong><br><br><strong>WE WELCOME YOU TO OCEAN CITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After years away from your hometown, you're running low on cash. It\u2019s time to pay a visit to an old friend in Ocean City.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033760/extras/2faa14418b7e878a28266311de867a1e.poster.avif?t=1760036170\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033760/extras/2faa14418b7e878a28266311de867a1e.webm?t=1760036170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033760/extras/2faa14418b7e878a28266311de867a1e.mp4?t=1760036170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>START YOUR BUSINESS ON THE DARKNET</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire buildings across the city and turn them into your operational headquarters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the demo, you can launch two types of businesses: <i>guns trafficking and a mining farm.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033760/extras/69547